  "source": [
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Kelp Knight Oseidon: the fork's model 11122 is its own id for cray_king_lowtide.adr; the 2014 client's Models.txt names that file 4446"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 10 ('Cray Caves (the live dungeon: cray from the beached boats up through the caves, '): scene ss_cray_caves, 6 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Tideweaver Oceana last; every spot is the fork's."
    },
    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Card: Global.Text 71694, 76456, icon 9555 (the fork battle's own ids)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: the scene ss_cray_caves needs one native load with this roster. The fork's scene layout, not a captured one; local kinds take ids 14064*100+n; knockouts, score, coins and the level gate are the fork fights' (fights/14xxx.json); job XP is the battles' 50."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) 1 later group(s) of the fork come as waves at their own spots: the first when the guards are down, each next one when the one before is down or 16 s after it (the captured Frostfang battle's gap)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) The guide's main goal is the one goal shown from the start and is done when the boss falls; the boss waits, dormant, for the waves. The results follow the exit door, which opens with the main goal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Built by scripts/dungeon_fights.py from data/content/dungeons/cray_caves.json, its notes page and the fork battle; under the id (14064) quests name."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "L1197: knockouts 5, the page's own \"Don't get knocked out 5 times\" (fr_place_cray_caves_b205d3.html); the generator's default was 15"
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "L1197: Kelp Knight Oseidon is the boss the main goal names (Global.Text 76459 'Defeat Kelp Knight Oseidon!'; the page: 'Primary: Defeat Kelp Knight Oseidon! Secondary: Defeat Tideweaver Oceania!'); the fork had Tideweaver Oceana last and Oseidon in the first wave, so they trade places"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Tideweaver Oceana keeps the fork's wave spot as an elite (a secondary boss, no goal row of its own: the engine shows one primary goal)"
    },
    {"kind": "wiki", "evidence": "L1194 (owner 2026-11-12: the end-of-battle prize wheel depends on the player's class): the wheel is this battle's own fanbyte page 'FR Place:Cray Caves' (Prize Wheel Rewards, one list per class plus its General Purpose part; cached lab/references/fanbyte-battles-20261112/FR_Place_Cray_Caves.html). Each class's wheel holds its own items and the shared items; the coins are the page's. (R) The wiki's spelling read as the client's item: 'Pinhole Archer Hoodie' as 'Pin Hole Archer Hoodie'; 'Wizard Power Shard of Vitality V' as 'Wizard's Power Shard of Vitality V'."}
  ]
